    <string name="download_confirm_title">Download SWAT 4</string>
    <string name="download_confirm_text">This option is for people who do not own the game. It downloads the DVD image from the OldUnreal servers and installs it on the device.\n\n• Download: about 3 GB (Wi-Fi advised)\n• Space needed: 9 GB during the install\n\nYou will then choose the installation folder.</string>
