    <string name="graphics_summary">Graphics: %1$dp · %2$s</string>
    <string name="graphics_help">The Vulkan driver is picked automatically: Turnip for Qualcomm Adreno GPUs, malisx2 for Arm Mali GPUs. If the screen is black or the game crashes at start-up, switch back to «Software» (slower). For a steady frame rate use 540p on entry-level phones. Frame generation interpolates between the two latest frames, making the display smoother at 60 Hz without asking anything more from the game.</string>
